**Explanation:**  
- Replace `"EBGP_GROUP"` with your actual EBGP peer group name.  
- This adds the link-bandwidth extended community to all IPv4 routes received from directly connected EBGP neighbors in the group.  
- The bandwidth value is derived from the physical interface capacity facing the neighbor.  

**Verification:**  
After configuration, check routes from EBGP peers:
```
show router bgp routes <prefix> detail | match "Link Bandwidth"
