To ensure the router uses preconfigured direct tunnels for BGP IPv6 routes without MPLS tags, configure the BGP next-hop resolution to utilize Segment Routing OSPFv3 tunnels:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        next-hop-resolution
            shortcut-tunnel
                family ipv6
                    resolution-filter
                        sr-ospf3
                    exit
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

This automatically resolves next-hops using OSPFv3 segment routing tunnels, bypassing manual mappings.
