- `stale-routes-time 3600` sets the maximum retention period for stale routes during graceful restart to **3600 seconds (1 hour)**, ensuring they remain in the routing table and are advertised to all peers, including external neighbors.  

These adjustments ensure stale paths are retained and propagated throughout the extended grace window.
