- `post-import`: Applies limits only to rules accepted after import policies

**Example**:
```cli
configure router bgp
    group DDoS_GROUP
        neighbor 192.0.2.1
            prefix-limit flow-ipv4 5000 threshold 70 log-only post-import
            prefix-limit flow-ipv6 5000 threshold 70 log-only post-import
```

This configuration validates flow rule legitimacy by:
1. Applying limits after import policy checks (`post-import`)
2. Triggering log warnings at 70% capacity
