To enable VPN route exchange between autonomous systems via BGP on your Nokia 7750 SR, configure the following:

```cli
/configure router bgp
    enable-inter-as-vpn
exit

/configure router policy-options
begin
    policy-statement VPN_NH_UNCHANGED
        entry 10
            from family vpn-ipv4
            action next-hop unchanged
            accept
        exit
    commit
exit

/configure router bgp group <PARTNER_GROUP> neighbor <NEIGHBOR_IP>
    family vpn-ipv4
    export VPN_NH_UNCHANGED
exit
```

**Key adjustments:**
1. `enable-inter-as-vpn` activates inter-AS VPNv4/v6 route exchange (ASBR model B).
2. The `VPN_NH_UNCHANGED` policy preserves the original next-hop for VPN routes when advertising to the partner's EBGP neighbor.
3. Apply the policy to the partner neighbor/group under the VPN-IPv4 address family.

Replace `<PARTNER_GROUP>` and `<NEIGHBOR_IP>` with your specific BGP neighbor details. If using VPN-IPv6, duplicate the policy entry with `family vpn-ipv6`.
