   Enables label security for VPN routes at inter-AS boundaries, preventing label spoofing.

2. **`extended-nh-encoding label-ipv4 vpn-ipv4`**  
   Restricts BGP peers to sending labeled IPv4/VPN-IPv4 routes only if they support extended next-hop capabilities, blocking malformed updates.

3. **`remove-private`**  
   Strips private AS numbers from outbound advertisements to external peers, hiding internal topology.

4. **`autonomous-system <your_AS_number>`**  
   Defines the router's ASN for BGP peering.

5. **`family vpn-ipv4 vpn-ipv6`**  
   Enables VPN address families for the BGP group handling inter-AS routes.

