To enable equal-cost multipath (ECMP) for your iBGP routes on the Nokia 7750 SR, configure the following:

```cli
configure router
    bgp
        best-path-selection
            ignore-router-id
        exit
        multipath 8 ibgp 8 restrict exact-as-path
    exit
exit
```

