1. Creates an AS-Path regex matching any path ending with `<neighbor-as>`.
2. Builds a policy that rejects routes not matching this regex (i.e., last AS ≠ neighbor's AS).
3. Applies the policy to the neighbor's import direction, enforcing validation.
