To enforce selective tunnel association for BGP-labeled routes on your Nokia 7750 SR, configure a resolution filter under BGP next-hop resolution. Use the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        labeled-routes
            transport-tunnel
                family ipv4
                    resolution filter
                    resolution-filter rsvp sr-isis sr-ospf sr-te
                exit
            exit
        exit
    exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `resolution filter` restricts BGP to only use explicitly allowed tunnel types.  
- `resolution-filter` specifies permitted LSP types (e.g., `rsvp` for RSVP-TE, `sr-isis`/`sr-ospf` for Segment Routing IGP, `sr-te` for SR-TE). Omit unwanted types (e.g., `ldp` or `bgp`).  
