To set up RSVP-based paths for optimal BGP route selection on Nokia 7750 SR, configure BGP to prioritize RSVP tunnels using the following CLI commands:

```cli
configure router bgp
    next-hop-resolution
        shortcut-tunn
            family ipv4
                resolution-filter rsvp
            exit
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Key details:**
- This configures BGP to resolve next hops using RSVP tunnels only
- BGP automatically selects the RSVP LSP with the **lowest metric** for forwarding
- If multiple LSPs have the same metric, BGP picks the tunnel with the **lowest tunnel ID**
- Adjust RSVP LSP metrics directly under MPLS configuration to influence path selection:
  ```cli
  configure router mpls lsp "LSP_NAME"
      metric <value>
  exit
  ```

**Verification:**  
Check resolved BGP paths using:
```cli
show router bgp routes <prefix> detail | match "Next Hop"
show router tunnel-table <bgp-next-hop-ip>
```
