```cli
configure router
    bgp
        group "DYNAMIC_Peers"
            dynamic-neighbor
                prefix 203.0.113.0/24
            exit
            cluster 198.51.100.1 orr-location 3
        exit
    exit
exit
```
This dynamically accepts peers within `203.0.113.0/24` into ORR location `3`.

### Optional stability enhancement:
```cli
configure router
    bgp
        damping
    exit
exit
```
Enables route damping to suppress flapping routes system-wide, reducing update storms.
