To minimize delay in IPv6 multicast VPN route updates on your Nokia 7750 SRs, enable BGP add-paths for MVPN IPv6 to advertise and receive multiple paths instantly. Configure this at the BGP group level:

```cli
configure router bgp
    group <your_group_name>
        family mvpn-ipv6
        add-paths
            mvpn-ipv6 send 16 receive
        exit
    exit
```

**Key parameters:**  
- `send 16`: Advertises up to 16 paths per prefix for rapid failover  
- `receive`: Accepts multiple paths from peers for immediate convergence  

Ensure `<your_group_name>` matches your BGP group. This configuration accelerates updates during multicast group changes by allowing simultaneous path advertisements without waiting for withdrawals.
